```

다음 결과는?

```java
enum Day { MONDAY, TUESDAY, SUNDAY }
EnumMap<Day, Integer> hours = new EnumMap<>(Day.class);
hours.put(Day.SUNDAY, null);
hours.put(Day.MONDAY, 8);
Integer a = hours.getOrDefault(Day.SUNDAY, 0);
Integer b = hours.getOrDefault(Day.TUESDAY, 0);
System.out.println(a + "/" + b + "/" + hours.keySet());
```
